Bundle-Name: Gecko DDSR Harness MQTT Configuration
Bundle-Description: \
	Harness-only configuration bundle (FR-P4 Scenario D): wakes the \
	dormant MQTT client transport (configurationPolicy REQUIRE) with \
	localhost Mosquitto settings and points the client's eventSource \
	reference at the MQTT source. Included ONLY in the client-mqtt \
	launch variant. \
	\
	It deliberately does NOT configure the broker's PID any more: the \
	broker reads DDSR_MQTT_URL from its environment, so the harness \
	runs the shipped broker image with that variable and exercises the \
	documented surface. Two bundles configuring one PID is a contest \
	the configurator decides by ranking, and without one the winner \
	depended on the machine — green here, red in CI. \
	\
	Deliberately a bundle rather than configurator.initial: the initial \
	property is parsed while the jakarta.json provider bundle may not \
	be started yet, and JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS strips the double quotes any \
	inline JSON needs.

-includeresource: \
	OSGI-INF/configurator/=configs/
Require-Capability: osgi.extender;filter:='(osgi.extender=osgi.configurator)'
